  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/PaellasToga.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(79 fotos) Toga ha vivido en la recta final de sus fiestas patronales el animado d&iacute;a de las paellas, este mi&eacute;rcoles, un poco como el a&ntilde;o pasado bajo la amenaza de lluvia, pero esta vez no ha aparecido hasta la tarde.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0769.jpg\" alt=\"img_0769\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0771.jpg\" alt=\"img_0771\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0773.jpg\" alt=\"img_0773\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0774.jpg\" alt=\"img_0774\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0775.jpg\" alt=\"img_0775\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0777.jpg\" alt=\"img_0777\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0778.jpg\" alt=\"img_0778\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0779.jpg\" alt=\"img_0779\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0780.jpg\" alt=\"img_0780\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paelles-toga-17/img_0782.jpg\" alt=\"img_0782\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto